    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>it's just not that these feelings \"pass.\" i've felt this way for a long time now. it's more that the world is moving on and i'm just... stuck. dragging a body that doesn't work and a mind that's just tired. it feels less like a phase and more like everything is just finished, you know? like the chapter is already over and i'm just staring at the blank pages.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
